laiming an action does not execute it. 12 responses /16 calls maximum. Citation quotes must be copied verbatim from an actual lookup, and both records must be cited. After required retrieval, the coordinator requests a JSON final answer matching the save schema and submits it through the authorised save handler. Do not claim a save yourself. Source catalog: [{\"record_id\":\"jufe-coverage-2026-10-11\",\"total_lines\":160},{\"record_id\":\"jufe-schedule-2026-10-11\",\"total_lines\":212}]. Read ranges of at most 80 lines. Independently lookup every draft citation range, then check whether each statement follows from it. Reject errors/unsupported claims. checked_citations must include every zero-based finding index on approval. Do not rubber stamp."
